+| word2-startup-r21 | tpl | 299.013 | 305.852 | 820.696 | 0.9659 [0.9463, 1.0253] |
+| word2-final-followup-r21 | durbin | 37.366 | 37.867 | 51.334 | 0.9933 [0.9767, 1.0183] |
